      "comment": "SIENNA'S SONG (5) was on speed settling but found some traffic when checked, missing the frame to finish seventh (25.83) at this track in a Maiden. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break off the middle. Rates a top chance. GALBA CAM (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind My Little Shark (20.01) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Must be included in calculations. JUST ROLLING (2) produced a moderate run last time when sixth at Bulli over 400m behind Near Miss (23.07) in a Maiden. Was in the money prior to that. Worth following up. MR. STARKEY (4) cannot be ruled out.",
